From 9dbca7c0d57c2747d39bbe193b7c0562e7f83b8e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tanmay Varun <varuntanmay21@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 11:06:42 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] fix(agent): role-conditioned SEARCH hypothesis ranking

Stop discarding goal_match/sender before explore-order. Rank candidates
via structured interpretation (relevance/relation/unknowns/contradictions)
instead of 4-feature lexical ties. SEARCH owns chosen_label; ACT must not
silently re-rank. Distractor hosts contradict even with query-in-path.
Mandatory hypothesis_ledger instrumentation + transfer goldens.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
